  "theoryOfChange": "350.org has a published Theory of Change, which outlines their belief that governments and corporations will not adequately address climate change without pressure from an organized movement of people. This framework emphasizes galvanizing public support, countering vested interests, and demonstrating alternative pathways to a thriving global community. Their mission is to inspire, train, and mobilize people to join a diverse climate movement that challenges systems leading to catastrophic climate change and works towards a just and sustainable future. The organization's strategy is twofold: resisting fossil fuel projects and their enablers, and advocating for a world powered by the sun, wind, and people. 350.org embarked on an ambitious process in 2019 to create a three-year strategy and a revised theory of change, aiming to ground staff in the 'why' of their work.",
